63787054_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8UdMmvoQLdIQ7kNvwHolWsV&_nc_oc=AdmIghSxyOcAAD8tl0Axv9VqmcqXPyQUZqLRZ_09fFkA3V4JUBDaBKLyoQfRltvF6v4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwqugf7Xi1VL4j2PQn6KiWInbae62JOTKTGcjYMcY436Q&oe=69B9660F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Car Jump VR-Ramp stunt", "keywords": ["carjumpvr", "carstunts", "rampjump", "magaramps", "carracinggames"], "long_description": "Welcome To the car jump ,i am your Car let's jump \nAre you ready to master extreme stunts? Take on the Car Jump VR-Ramp stunt game and embark on an adventure like no other. Gear up, rev your engines, and prepare for a high-flying, heart-stopping experience. The mega ramp car stunt game beckons\u2014the ramps are calling, and the stage is set for you to shine.\n\nKey Features of Mega Ramp Car Game:\n- Diverse selection of luxury racing stunt cars\n- Multiple HD graphics car racing tracks\n- Realistic and smooth controls for the mega ramp car game\n- Authentic sound effects enhancing the racing car game experience\n- Exciting car games simulator challenges with a focus on thrilling stunts\n- Perform daring stunts in the mega ramp racing game\n- Engaging and challenging levels", "short_description": "Are you ready to jump? Take on the Car jump VR-Ramp stunt and embark on an adventure like no other. Gear up, rev your engines, and prepare for a high-flying, heart-stopping experience. The mega ramp car stunt game beckons\u2014the ramps are calling, and the stage is set for you to shine."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rixxxstudio/meta-quest-privacy-policies", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rexxxstudio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rixxxstudio/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "274332603